  <name>VitaPlex</name>
  <summary>Native Plex client for desktop and consoles</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      VitaPlex is a native Plex client built on borealis and libmpv. It browses
      your Plex libraries and plays movies, shows, music and live TV with a
      controller-friendly interface.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Direct play and transcoding via libmpv</li>
      <li>Downloads for offline playback</li>
      <li>SyncLounge watch-together support</li>
      <li>Live TV and DVR</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.breezyslasher.VitaPlex.desktop</launchable>
